%A7%86%E9%A2%91%EF%BC%9A%E5%B0%8F%E5%9C%BA%E8%AE%B0%E5%B8%A6%E4%BD%A0%E6%B8%B8%E7%89%87%E5%9C%BA%E4%B9%8B%E4%BD%A3%E5%85%B5%E5%9B%A2%E5%8A%9E%E5%85%AC%E5%AE%A4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"编辑章节：【探班视频】小场记带你游片场之佣兵团办公室\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h1>\n<div class=\"sidebar-card\" style=\"margin:15px 0px\"><b>本文来自</b>：官方微信公众号<br /><b>原作者</b>：铃兰之剑摄制组<br /><b>发布时间</b>：2021-11-18 14:49<br /><b>原视频/文章地址</b>：<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"http://game.bilibili.com/linkfilter/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmp.weixin.qq.com%2Fs%2FSsi3cisuhTQ4YOSAvWmzwQ\" target=\"_blank\">https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/Ssi3cisuhTQ4YOSAvWmzwQ</a></div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\" style=\"background: #FFF\">\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<center>\n<p><img alt=\"官方消息19.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/e/e2/13ukrbr9hhqa9zk6wju4x2guycj6vmr.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1080\" height=\"113\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"113\" />\n<br /><br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息28.jpg\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/f/f4/cwj2ow2s1lsrwtx790mfge2m5umw5hj.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1080\" height=\"810\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"810\" />\n<br /><br /><br />\n</p>\n</center>\n<p>小场记全新栏目【场记探班记】第一期开播，本期为大家带来的是《铃兰之剑》最最重要的场景“佣兵团办公室”的建成故事。\n</p>\n<center>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%; border:0px; background-color:#ffffff\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td rowspan=\"5\" style=\"width:45%; border:2px solide; border-color:#ffffff\"><center><img alt=\"官方消息29.gif\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/1/17/fqbmtv5jv8v42483dfxnr5y7imn85mn.gif\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"271\" data-file-width=\"200\" data-file-height=\"271\" /></center>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"border-color:#ff8c00; width:80px; height:16px\"><b>小场记</b>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"border:0px; height:12px\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"border:0px; height:4px; background-color:#ffe4e1\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"border-color:#ffe4e1; background-color:#ffe4e1; height:24px\"><br />各位团长好，我是铃兰之剑摄制组的小场记，好久不见，有没有想我呀~\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"border-color:#ffe4e1; background-color:#ffe4e1; height:16px\">\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-color:#ff8c00; height:16px; width:100px; background-color:#ffe4e1\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"border:0px\">\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<br /></center>\n<p>继7月份《铃兰之剑》摄制组幕后日志和8月初ChinaJoy的报道之后，我的确沉寂了那么亿会儿~~\n<br /><br />\n这不带着新发色的我又回归了，当然这次回归我也是肩负重任——《铃兰之剑》的研发趣事、展会趣闻、角色幕后等等，都会由我为大家进行揭秘和报道。\n</p>\n<br /><br /><br /><center>\n<p><big><big><font color=\"#bdb76b\"><b>点击观看</b></font></big></big><b><br /></b>\n<small><font color=\"#bdb76b\">...............................................................................................................</font></small>\n<br /><br />\n</p>\n<div class=\"bvideo\" data-id=\"BV1Qq4y1u7Yf\" data-cid=\"0\" data-page=\"1\" data-title=\"小场记带你游片场之佣兵团办公室\" data-width=\"560\" data-height=\"280\"></div><br />\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%; border:0px\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"border:0px; width:5%; height:240px\">\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-color:#bdb76b\"><center><img alt=\"官方消息31.gif\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/0/04/niymmadsnkidd310tm6c16qse3wpn5n.gif\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"222\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"222\" /></center>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border:0px; width:5%\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"background-color:#bdb76b; color:#ffffff; height:40px\"><center>———同一场景天气的变化，角色也会有不同的光影———</center>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<br /></center>\n<p>11月20日~21日，小场记也将前往广州核聚变的现场，为大家带来第一手的速报！！\n</p>\n<br /><br /><center>\n<p>......................................................<img alt=\"官方消息32.gif\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/11/b2whu9tq2q2lvgp8hjyuzsdbdsaz0r9.gif/50px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF32.gif\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"67\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/11/b2whu9tq2q2lvgp8hjyuzsdbdsaz0r9.gif/75px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF32.gif 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/11/b2whu9tq2q2lvgp8hjyuzsdbdsaz0r9.gif/100px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF32.gif 2x\" data-file-width=\"200\" data-file-height=\"269\" />......................................................\n<img alt=\"官方二维码.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/4/4a/a513m9t3pnx0i3wobn6d2x1842m1v9r.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"928\" height=\"390\" data-file-width=\"928\" data-file-height=\"390\" />\n</p>\n</center>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022163500\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.036 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.084 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 117/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 3075/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 338/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   45.997      1 -total\n 56.98%   26.211      1 模板:文章戳\n 37.76%   17.369      1 模板:面包屑\n  4.87%    2.241      1 模板:B站视频\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key gamecenter_wiki_llzj-pre_:pcache:idhash:182-0!dateformat=default and timestamp 20261022163500 and revision id 1974. Serialized with PHP.\n -->\n</div>","categories":[{"sortkey":"","category":"专题"}],"images":["官方消息19.png","官方消息28.jpg","官方消息29.gif","官方消息31.gif","官方消息32.gif","官方二维码.png"],"sections":[{"toclevel":1,"level":"1","line":"【探班视频】小场记带你游片场之